      "content": "but it's not just a mistake, it's like... everything they believed in, everything they sacrificed for, it's all gone because of me. if i stay, i just keep failing them and making them ashamed. i feel like the only way to stop the shame is to just not be part of the story anymore. like i'm better off just gone so they can keep their dignity without me dragging them down.",
